# Implementation Plan - "Celestial Minimal" Design Overhaul

Re-work the entire application's aesthetic to achieve a state-of-the-art, minimalist, and sublime user experience.

## Design Principles
- **Elevated Depth**: Use layering and subtle shadows instead of harsh gradients.
- **Micro-interactions**: physics-based motion for every state change.
- **Generous Air**: Increased whitespace and precise typography hierarchy.
- **Hairline Precision**: 0.5px borders and ultra-refined icons.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component] Design System

#### [MODIFY] [index.css](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/index.css)
- Update color palette to "Celestial Obsidian" theme.
- Define advanced CSS tokens for spacing, blur, and radius.
- Implement sophisticated typography system (Outfit + Inter).

### [Component] UI Components

#### [MODIFY] [Button.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/ui/Button.tsx)
- Refine animations and transition timing.
- New "Lucent" and "Obsidian" variants.
- Adaptive padding for mobile vs desktop.

#### [MODIFY] [Card.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/ui/Card.tsx)
- Update glassmorphism effects (Level 2).
- Add inner border glows and soft outer shadows.
- Responsive padding (p-4 on mobile, p-8 on desktop).

### [Component] Page Layouts

#### [MODIFY] [Layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/Layout.tsx)
- Refine sidebar for a more integrated feel; switch to a bottom bar or overlay on mobile.
- Implement a "Viewport Centering" strategy for desktop to avoid ultra-wide line lengths.
- Standardized vertical spacing (Gutter System).

#### [MODIFY] [Pantry/Planner/Shopping Pages]
- Apply the new design system consistently.
- Refine form layouts and list representations.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Visual audit of every page.
- Test responsiveness.
- Verify micro-animations feel "premium" and not "bouncy".
